 reasoning='Define each expression as status/end/captures, including PENDING propagation. Prove capture rollback across sequence failure, failed choice and NOT, and explain why retrying a lower-priority branch after PENDING can select a wrong grammar result. Derive the forward-DAG depth bound, explicit node budget and32-capture bound. Explain why retrying full prefixes has a different total-work contract from an incremental state machine or memoized packrat parser. Keep recognition/captured spans separate from numeric or symbol-table effects.',
 verification='Compare literal/range/choice/sequence/star/not/capture behavior with an immutable-list model. Exercise every prefix of the declaration/assignment samples, both EOF flags, ambiguous prefixes, lookahead capture suppression, failed-branch capture rollback, empty-loop rejection, budget exhaustion and32/33 captures. Kill premature-EOF and leaked-speculative-capture mutants separately. The complete-input wrapper must reject a successful short prefix followed by extra bytes.',
 criteria=['Construct an actual scannerless precedence-composed recognition grammar with explicit keyword boundaries, prioritized choice and capture semantics.','Bound recursion, repetition progress, capture storage and malformed-input work; distinguish PENDING from failure and preserve result publication.', 'Preserve an independent immutable capture model and transfer to nonfinal-prefix recognition without claiming generic recursive PEG, memoization or linear-total-work behavior.'],
